Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:24:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix Microsoft sign-in lag and silent failure in Cursor
 preview

- Render the app immediately; only wait for MSAL when returning from Microsoft.
- Skip MSAL init inside preview iframes and insecure http pages (it hung or failed).
- In the Cursor/VS Code preview, open the app in the real browser to sign in.
- Move 127.0.0.1 / 0.0.0.0 to the registered localhost redirect.
- Show a clear message instead of 'Microsoft cloud sign-in is not connected'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KpwQi1koQyAcMumJxBKyKw
